{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "名片头衔引发办公室冲突  (Business Card Title Sparks an Office Clash)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After receiving his newly printed Xingtian business cards, an outraged Xie Ling marches into human resources demanding to know why his title is Unit One Chief Producer rather than Chief Content Officer. Listen to the Mandarin confrontation first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "雷总，我就想问一下，是不是我的名片印错了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "中英文都错了！我来星天是接任淳于乔的，为什么头衔不是首席内容官？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们赶紧给我查查吧，开什么玩笑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "淳于乔当副总裁能统辖四个部门，换我不行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我差哪儿了？我到底缺什么？你们说呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "缺什么自己心里清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你说什么？你把话给我说清楚了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谢老师，看这儿，看我嘴型：你缺德！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们几个阴魂不散是吧？我已经把你们开除了，还不滚蛋！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你让谁滚蛋呢？让你滚蛋！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "到底要不要脸啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我想教训你不是一年两年了，你给我出来！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "雷总，我就想问一下，是不是我的名片印错了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Lei, I just want to ask whether my business cards were printed wrong.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "中英文都错了！我来星天是接任淳于乔的，为什么头衔不是首席内容官？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Both Chinese and English are wrong! I came to succeed Chun Yuqiao, so why is my title not Chief Content Officer?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们赶紧给我查查吧，开什么玩笑！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hurry up and check the system for me—what kind of joke is this!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "淳于乔当副总裁能统辖四个部门，换我不行吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As vice president Chun Yuqiao oversaw all four production units—why cannot I do the same?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我差哪儿了？我到底缺什么？你们说呀！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Where do I fall short? What on earth am I lacking? Speak up!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "缺什么自己心里清楚。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You know perfectly well inside what you are lacking.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你说什么？你把话给我说清楚了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What did you just say? Spell that out clearly to my face!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "谢老师，看这儿，看我嘴型：你缺德！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Teacher Xie, look right here and read my lips: what you lack is basic decency!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们几个阴魂不散是吧？我已经把你们开除了，还不滚蛋！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You lot linger around like ghosts, do you? I already fired you—get lost right now!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "你让谁滚蛋呢？让你滚蛋！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who are you telling to get lost? You get lost yourself!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "到底要不要脸啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you got no shame whatsoever!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "我想教训你不是一年两年了，你给我出来！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have wanted to teach you a lesson for years—step outside right now!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "雷总，我就想问一下，是不是我的名片印错了？",
      "gap": 0.5
